page('/privacy/','Privacy information','How this static website and its connected features handle information.', '<div class="portal-prose"><h2>Learning progress</h2><p>Completed lessons and quiz scores are stored in your browser’s local storage. They are not sent to a REX account service. Clearing site data removes that local copy. Export files contain your progress and scores.</p><h2>Analytics and external displays</h2><p>The site uses its existing Google Analytics tag. TradingView widgets and reference-rate requests contact external services, which receive ordinary connection information such as an IP address. Their own privacy policies apply.</p><h2>Email and Telegram</h2><p>The free-plan forms send the email address you enter to Rex’s existing subscription service. Telegram links open Telegram, where its policies and the channel’s practices apply. Do not enter sensitive account information in a signup form.</p><h2>Questions or requests</h2><p>Contact Rex through the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> for questions about email subscriptions or personal information. No retention period beyond the existing service’s practices is asserted here.</p></div>')
page('/terms/','Site terms & use','Use the educational material and tools with an understanding of their limits.', '<div class="portal-prose"><h2>Educational purpose</h2><p>Articles, lessons, examples and calculator outputs are general learning resources. They are not individualized financial advice, promises of return or instructions to enter a trade.</p><h2>Data and calculations</h2><p>Verify instrument specifications and external data before relying on a result. Information can be delayed, incomplete or revised. Hypothetical examples are not an investment track record.</p><h2>Existing paid products</h2><p>The Trader’s Business Kit retains the inclusions, prices and refund terms shown on its <a href="/#kit">original offer</a>. This page creates no new subscription or payment agreement.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>External websites and embedded tools operate under their own terms. Provider attribution does not imply an endorsement or affiliation.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Report errors or ask about intended use through the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p></div>')
page('/risk-disclosure/','Risk disclosure','Understand what the educational content and planned-risk calculations cannot promise.', '<div class="portal-prose"><p>Trading gold, forex, leveraged products and cryptoassets can result in substantial losses. Some products or arrangements can expose you to losses beyond an initial margin deposit. Protections depend on the product, provider and jurisdiction.</p><p>Stops may execute at different prices during gaps, fast markets or limited liquidity. A calculated risk budget is a plan, not a guarantee. Past performance and individual testimonials do not establish future results.</p><p>Rex does not manage your account through these pages. The existing channel is supported by a broker-paid introducing commission as disclosed on the homepage. Consider costs, counterparty risk and whether you understand the product before making any decision.</p></div>')
